WEBVTT

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:04.280
A-da-m

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:57.240
What's wrong?

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:02.610
You shouldn't be here. Your room is over there.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.270
What's wrong?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.580
What's goin' on?

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:12.000
I think he came in because he was lonely.

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:14.700
Come on.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.310
What kind of card is this, anyways?

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.050
Because it was in those ruins...

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.900
...maybe it's related to the kid in some way.

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:42.560
It's hard to say.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:45.990
Anyways, let's check it out.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:46.890
You betcha.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.290
Then you take care of it.

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.580
I'll go work in the field.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:52.630
Got it.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.440
Bell and Howard, lend him a hand.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:56.420
Got it.

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:59.980
The field? Give me a break!

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.610
Menori and I will make dried food.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.910
I'll help once the dishes are done.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:10.880
What do we do about the kid?

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:14.480
I'm not sure...

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:18.540
Looks like there's no choice. I'll look after him.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.300
Field work is so hard, ain't it?

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:26.870
What are you saying? If someone's looking after him, everyone can do their jobs, right?

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.440
It's for everyone's sake!

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:31.800
Hey, let's go play.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:36.090
See? He's taken a shine to me.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:38.310
Then by all means, do.

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:41.360
Be a good boy, Alduram Gyet.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:44.040
What's that?

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:46.050
Remember, from back then?

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:50.080
.dlihc siht rof erac esaelP

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.580
Alduram Gyet.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.390
I think that was this kid's name.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:05:00.990
Hey, Abornal... um... what was it?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.960
Well, whatever. Let's go.

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:09.830
Yep, I'll teach you all kinds of good stuff.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.610
It's generatin' electricity.

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:27.730
Electricity?

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:31.050
What happened?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.390
The voltage decreased.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.150
It went back up.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:40.840
Solar power!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:41.960
Prob'ly.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.100
Maybe we can use it for the communicator.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.030
The problem's how much power it can generate.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.970
In the meantime, let's try putting it in the fire light.

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:53.720
Good idea. We might be able to store the generated energy too.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:55.350
You wanna try it?

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.160
Keep quiet.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.510
In exchange, I'll show you something good.

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:05.590
How about it? There's all kinds, aren't there?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.070
Wait!

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:10.990
If you take from the front, they'll notice.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:13.200
Take them from the back.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:17.720
See?

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.830
Eat right down to the core so you don't get caught.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.400
Then there's no evidence.

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:28.670
Huh? You're already finished?

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:31.480
Luna, you only have three or four left yourself, right?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.220
It's nice to be finished so early.

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:39.240
You're right, we're done!

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:42.320
We've made good progress.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.470
Hey, Luna's coming this way.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.640
Hurry back to the room.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:51.470
Hey, stop that!

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.700
Howard! Howard!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.920
Stop that! Stop it!

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:05.980
What's wrong?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.160
Stop that this instant, Alduram Gyet!

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.230
Right in the eyes! Damn!

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:25.590
Our food is precious.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.620
We can't afford to waste even a bit.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:28.670
Look!

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.670
We can't eat that anymore.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:40.440
Hey, Abdu...

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:41.780
...no, Ababe...

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:43.890
...ah, whatever, just Adam's fine!

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.580
Put those back where they were!

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:51.000
For crying out loud! I told you to eat them so you wouldn't get caught!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.670
So you taught him that?

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.720
No, I mean, you see...

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.280
It's true, isn't it?

00:07:58.560 --> 00:07:59.790
Well, the thing is...

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:02.700
I guess you'll be cleaning up after him then.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.480
Of course!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.710
You all heard it, right?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.090
Let's all take a break.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.460
Well, have at it.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:13.050
But isn't Adam a great name?

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:14.310
It's easy to say.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:16.030
That's true.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:17.460
"Adam," huh?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:18.900
Sounds good.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.710
How would you like your name to be Adam?

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.850
I think it's a good name.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.080
Don't!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:53.810
Stop that, Adam!

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:58.610
Adam, didn't I tell you our food was precious?

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:27.730
H- hey! Stop that!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:28.690
Stop it!

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:29.660
Adam!

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:32.830
You shouldn't do that.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.950
These are also our precious food.

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:39.990
They're going to get even bigger, so if you pull them out now, we won't be able to eat them.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.360
Got that, Adam?

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.310
This place is a valuable source of food.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.840
You mustn't cause harm to it again.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.430
Do you understand? You won't do it again, will you?

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.080
Lu-na.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.680
C'mon, try saying my name.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:37.860
Lu-na.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.460
My name's easier to remember!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.380
It's Chako, Chako!

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:44.570
Shingo! Shin-go!

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:45.530
Try saying it.

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:49.860
None of you understand at all.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:54.510
The name 'Adam' is the easiest. Right, Adam?

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:58.730
Look! He likes me best after all.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.610
He's prob'ly just laughin' 'cuz he thinks your face is funny.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.280
Shut up!

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:08.310
Pure-spirited children can be affected by ill-natured people around them.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.730
Learn from my noble example, okay?

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:16.740
I didn't know fruit thieves could be noble.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:19.390
Hey, Adam.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:21.210
This is my seat.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:23.440
I'm going to sleep early.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:01.460
Don't touch it!

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:03.460
It's my precious violin!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.530
It's not your toy!

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:20.180
Adam just wants you to care about him, Menori.

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.000
I'm not good with children.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:33.840
Why?

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:39.060
I don't know what to do when I get fawned on by children.

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.290
Try smiling kindly at them.

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:45.940
I...

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:47.940
I should?

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:13.590
Chako and Shingo will keep working on the analysis of the card.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:17.960
The rest of us will split up and do our respective jobs.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:20.400
I'll work on the food drying.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:22.590
I'll work with you.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:25.160
I'll look after Adam.

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:27.960
I'm afraid not. We're short on hands today.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.360
You'll be helping us too, Howard.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:31.430
Adam!

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.310
Be a good boy and don't interfere with our work.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:37.710
Bell, continue with the weeding.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:38.720
Got it.

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.160
I'll go search for food.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:44.490
Sharla, you go with Kaoru.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.260
I killed him.

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:53.190
Sharla?

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:57.510
I'm fine on my own.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:02.780
Kaoru...

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.260
Did something happen between you and Kaoru?

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.010
What's wrong? You're acting oddly.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.590
It was the day when you all when to the ruins...

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:26.080
...and Kaoru and I stayed behind at the house...

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:31.630
Killed?

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:33.020
Kaoru did?

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:37.480
He said, "I killed the person in the picture."

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:39.360
And then?

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.240
I didn't ask any more.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.610
I can't ask!

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:44.930
I suppose not...

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.360
I'm sure there's a deeper explanation to it.

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:53.360
I'm not suited to mindless labour.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:00.810
Are you done?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:02.480
Umm...

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:04.480
You're great, Adam.

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:06.390
You seemed terrible at it yesterday...

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:09.560
...it looks like I lucked out.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:21.510
Do you understand?

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.990
Fire is hot. It's dangerous, so don't get too close.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.840
We told you it was hot! Do you want to get burned?

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.190
Don't stop him!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.760
He'll remember things one at a time this way.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:37.910
Anyways...

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:40.010
...its dangerous, so don't get too close.

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:49.370
He seems to be a fast learner.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:52.280
He's learned how to set out food to dry...

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.530
...and I'm sure he won't do this again either.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:57.980
Surprisingly, he might turn out to be smarter than us.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.750
Adam, let's go to the water.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.940
Adam.

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:42.810
Just like I said yesterday, do it quietly.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.360
That way we won't get caught.

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:48.580
What's wrong?

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:53.180
Hey! I said take it!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:59.340
You're not going to listen to what I say?

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.610
Hey! Wait up!

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:07.180
What's up with him?

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:20.180
Very nice! You're great at this!

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:27.560
Praise him.

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:31.650
Very good.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.410
Well done.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.680
Isn't it great, Adam?

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:38.340
Menori praised you.

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:39.620
All that's left is Kaoru.

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:41.720
He might be harder than I was.

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:43.910
You got that right!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.230
Adam liked me the best!

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:52.540
And then..

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:54.540
...that Menori...

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:05.040
Those clouds are somehow creepy.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.930
They're sparklin' here 'n there.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:16.480
It's sure gotten cold.

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:18.640
Maybe it's because the sun's blocked.

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:20.570
It might even rain.

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:22.970
Let's get the work done early.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.720
I agree. Let's get things split up.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:30.380
Chako, Shingo, take care of analysis on the card.

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:33.560
There's so much we don't know.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.380
It'll take a while still.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.480
By the way, where's Adam?

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:39.940
I left him with Howard.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:42.690
It's okay.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:45.530
I think his judgment has improved enough.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.360
Where did Menori leave it?

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:55.890
There it is!

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:04.590
Why don't you play with this?

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:06.450
It's fun!

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:27.750
What are you doing?

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.120
Adam! Menori...

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.910
Why did you touch my violin?

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:41.550
Do you even know what you've done?

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:45.860
Adam, what have you done?

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:47.140
I'm sorry, Menori.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.030
I just took my eyes off him for a moment.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:50.910
Forget it!

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:55.430
Anyways, just calm down!

00:19:56.230 --> 00:20:00.620
It's not like Adam meant anything bad by it.

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:03.060
He just really likes the violin.

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:06.960
To think that he'd find it under your bed, though...

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.700
Howard, how do you know where I hid it?

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.680
Did you give it to him?

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:20.610
No, er...

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:22.630
You gave it to him, didn't you?

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:27.230
Adam kept telling me to give him the violin, you see...

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.040
If I turned him down, he'd be a nuisance to everyone.

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:31.520
--So...
--Shut up!

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:36.410
I was jealous!

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.720
Because Adam took a liking to Menori!

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:43.520
Now the misunderstanding's been cleared up.

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:45.340
Isn't that great, Adam?

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.680
Huh? Adam's gone!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:57.530
Adam! (many, many times)

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:16.200
Adam...

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:31.890
It wasn't your fault.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:33.280
Please don't cry.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:41.930
I was in the wrong.

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:44.760
Please forgive me.

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:53.290
Adam...

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:00.710
Isn't that great?

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.590
Me-no-ri...

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:10.220
Yes.

00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:12.000
I'm Menori.

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:14.360
Can you say your own name too?

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:16.310
You're Adam.

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:22.890
A-da-m.

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.660
He spoke!

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:26.490
He remembered it!

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:27.600
Wow, wow!

00:22:28.760 --> 00:22:30.340
Well, let's go home.

00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:04.780
In the middle of the sudden cold here...

00:23:05.190 --> 00:23:07.560
...Bell suggests we move to a cave.

00:23:07.990 --> 00:23:09.410
Things're tough.

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:12.730
On top a' food bein' short...

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:15.690
...this ain't no time to be buildin' a new house.

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:18.680
You're right. We're short on hands as it is.

00:23:19.260 --> 00:23:24.020
But based on what Bell's said until now, he must have some reason he can't ignore.

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.200
Next time: Winter approaches.
